\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 LangChain is built on LangGraph, so every tool is a node in a graph. 
\f2\fs26 execution_info
\f1\fs24  exposes the run ID, thread ID, and attempt number for that node, which is what you need when debugging how many times something ran.\
